<title>USA: TABLE - Dow Chemical Co Q2 net up.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Dow Chemical Co Q2 net up.</headline>
<dateline>MIDLAND, Mich. 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>(in millions, except for share amount)</p>
<p>						 Q2	   Six Months</p>
<p>					  1997   1996   1997	1996</p>
<p> Net Sales			  $5,366 $5,176 $10,358   $10,158</p>
<p> Total oper costs, expenses    4,554  4,280   8,781     8,394</p>
<p> Operating Income		    812    896   1,577     1,764</p>
<p> Total other income (expense)    178     43     217	  58</p>
<p> Provision for Taxes on Income   370    344     659	 670</p>
<p>Minority Interests' Share in Income</p>
<p>					    48     48     109	 127</p>
<p> Preferred Stock Dividends	   1	1	 3	   3</p>
<p> Net Available for Common	  571    546   1,023     1,022</p>
<p> Average Shares Outstanding    229.9  247.7   233.8     249.3</p>
<p> Earnings per Common Share	2.48   2.20    4.38	4.10</p>
<p>NOTE: Q2 1997 net includes net gain of $0.23 a share from one-time events, including sale of majority stake in Destec Inc and charges related to insurance restructuring, shutdown of ethylene cracker in Texas, and charges DowElanco made related to purchase of Eli Lilly and Co's 40 percent stake in venture.</p>
<p>Q2 1997 oper income was $2.25/share.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
